ents Inventory\' in `bq79616_scud.md` again.\\n\\n**Integrated Circuits**\\n*   **U1:** TI BQ79616PAPQ1 (16-Channel Battery Monitor) -> Found `imports/BQ79616PAPRQ1`\\n*   **U2:** TI ISO7342CQDWRQ1 (Digital Isolator) -> Found `imports/ISO7342CDWR`\\n\\n**Transistors**\\n*   **Q1:** NPN Transistor (External LDO Pass Element). Active.\\n*   **Q2:** NPN Transistor footprint. DNP (Do Not Populate).\\n\\n**Temperature Sensing Components**\\n*   **Thermistors (NTC):** RT1, RT2, RT3, RT4, RT5, RT6, RT7, RT8.\\n\\n**GPIO1 Filter**\\n*   **D3:** 24V Dual Zener/TVS Diode\\n\\nI should check if I can find a suitable NPN transistor and a 24V Dual Zener.\\nSince no specific part numbers are given for Q1 and D3, I\'ll try to search for common ones that might be used in such a design.\\nActually, for Q1, a common NPN used as a pass element in BMS might be something like a MJD44H11 or similar, but I shouldn\'t guess.\\nWait, if I can\'t find a specific part number, maybe I should just map them to generic components if they exist in the library, or just note them as missing if I can\'t create them without a part number.\\n\\nWait, the instructions say \\"create missing components if necessary\\".\\nIf I don\'t have a part number, I can\'t really create a specific component.\\nHowever, I can check if there are any other components I can resolve.\\n\\nLet\'s try to resolve \\"NPN Transistor\\" and \\"24V Dual Zener\\".\\nActually, I\'ll search for \\"NPN\\" and \\"Zener\\"."}'}}, {'id': 'call_14da94acbb12468385e6d6501e69', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'arguments': '{"query": "NPN", "security_risk": "LOW"}'}}]}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Your thought has been logged.'}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_359fba7dc32449959794a3fcc490', 'name': 'think'}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': "[Tool 'resolve_component' executed.]"}, {'type': 'text', 'text': '{\n  "status": "no_results",\n  "message": "No results found matching your query."