ic components if they exist in the library, or just note them as missing if I can\'t create them without a part number.\n\nWait, the instructions say "create missing components if necessary".\nIf I don\'t have a part number, I can\'t really create a specific component.\nHowever, I can check if there are any other components I can resolve.\n\nLet\'s try to resolve "NPN Transistor" and "24V Dual Zener".\nActually, I\'ll search for "NPN" and "Zener".'}}, 'thoughtSignature': 'c2tpcF90aG91Z2h0X3NpZ25hdHVyZV92YWxpZGF0b3I='}, {'function_call': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'args': {'query': 'NPN', 'security_risk': 'LOW'}}, 'thoughtSignature': 'c2tpcF90aG91Z2h0X3NpZ25hdHVyZV92YWxpZGF0b3I='}]}, {'parts': [{'function_response': {'name': 'think', 'response': {'content': 'Your thought has been logged.'}}}, {'function_response': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'response': {'content': '[Tool \'resolve_component\' executed.]{\n  "status": "no_results",\n  "message": "No results found matching your query."\n}'}}}]}, {'role': 'model', 'parts': [{'function_call': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'args': {'query': 'Zener', 'security_risk': 'LOW'}}, 'thoughtSignature': 'c2tpcF90aG91Z2h0X3NpZ25hdHVyZV92YWxpZGF0b3I='}]}, {'parts': [{'function_response': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'response': {'content': '[Tool \'resolve_component\' executed.]{\n  "status": "no_results",\n  "message": "No results found matching your query."\n}'}}}]}, {'role': 'model', 'parts': [{'function_call': {'name': 'think', 'args': {'thought': 'Okay, so no generic NPN or Zener found via `resolve_component`.\nWait, I should check if I can find a specific NPN like MMBT3904.'}}, 'thoughtSignature': 'c2tpcF90aG91Z2h0X3NpZ25hdHVyZV92YWxpZGF0b3I='}, {'function_call': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'args': {'security_risk': 'LOW', 'query': 'MMBT3904'}}, 'thoughtSignature': 'c2tpcF90aG91Z2h0X3NpZ25hdHVyZV92YWxpZGF0b3I='}]}, {'parts': [{'function_response': {'name': 'think', 'response': {'content': 'Your thought has been logged