                             (DNP) on RT8 channel.\n    86\t\n    87\t# Connectivity & Signal Flow\n    88\t\n                         
                             89\t**Main IC (U1) Connections:**\n    90\t*   **Cell Inputs:** `VC0` through `VC16` connect              
