   350  ## 🤖 LLM Agent Integration Guide
   351  
   352  ### Overview
   353  
   354  VHL Library is designed to be used by LLM agents to manage hardware components. The MCP protocol provides a standardized 
interface that agents can use to:
   355  
   356  1. Search for components in local and global libraries
   357  2. Add new components with automatic validation
   358  3. List existing local components
   359  4. Manage component dependencies
   360  
   361  ### Integration Steps
   362  
   363  #### Step <response clipped><NOTE>Due to the max output limit, only part of this file has been shown to you. You should retry 
this tool after you have searched inside the file with `grep -n` in order to find the line numbers of what you are looking 
for.</NOTE>ponentName(generatedCode),
   364        file_content: generatedCode
   365      });
   366  
   367      // 5. Handle validation errors
   368      if (!result.success) {
   369        // Retry with fixed code
   370        const fixedCode = await this.fixValidationErrors(
   371          generatedCode,
   372          result.errors
   373        );
   374        
   375        return await callMCPTool('add_component', {
   376          component_name: this.extractComponentName(fixedCode),
   377          file_content: fixedCode
   378        });
   379      }
   380  
   381      return { created: true, path: result.componentPath };
   382    }
   383  }
   384  ```
