ric footprints if I were to create them.\\nBut wait, I can\'t really \\"create\\" a component without a datasheet or specific requirements.\\nThe main ICs are the most important.\\n\\nLet\'s check if there are any other components in the inventory that are specific.\\n- TI BQ79616PAPQ1 (U1) - Found\\n- TI ISO7342CQDWRQ1 (U2) - Found\\n- NPN Transistor (Q1) - Found MMBT3904 as a placeholder\\n- 24V Dual Zener/TVS Diode (D3) - Found BZX84C24 as a placeholder\\n\\nWait, I should check if there are any other ICs. No.\\nConnectors? J4, J5, J17, J18, J21, J1, J2, J3.\\nUsually, we don\'t create connectors unless they are special.\\n\\nLet\'s look at the SCUD file again to see if I missed anything.\\n\\"RT1, RT2, RT3, RT4, RT5, RT6, RT7, RT8\\" - Thermistors.\\nI can search for a common NTC thermistor."}'}}, {'id': 'call_63fa9b50cfb94fafb3559e2a93ec', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'arguments': '{"security_risk": "LOW", "query": "NTC Thermistor"}'}}]}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Your thought has been logged.'}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_64510cfc18d3430cb5ca7811166a', 'name': 'think'}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': "[Tool 'resolve_component' executed.]"}, {'type': 'text', 'text': '{\n  "status": "no_results",\n  "message": "No results found matching your query."\n}'}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_63fa9b50cfb94fafb3559e2a93ec', 'name': 'resolve_component'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_a286659fd0a74fab84a8bced3542', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'resolve_component', 'arguments': '{"query": "NTC 10k", "security_risk": "LOW"}'}}]}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': "[Tool 'resolve_component' executed.]"}, {'type': 'text', 'text': '{\n  "status": "no_results",\n  "message": "No results found matching your query."\n}'}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_a286659fd0a74fab84a8bced3542', 'name': 'resolve_component'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_0cd